  "verseCount": 27,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "9",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1SA 9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "9",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwakukhona indoda yakoBenjamini ibizo layo linguKishi, indodana kaAbiyeli, kaZerori, kaBekorathi, kaAfiya, owakoBenjamini; yayiyindoda enothileyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yayilendodana ibizo layo linguSawuli; ilijaha elihle; kwakungelamuntu omuhle kulayo phakathi kwabakoIsrayeli. Kusukela emahlombe akhe kusiya phezulu wayemude kulabo bonke abantu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obabhemi bakaKishi, uyise kaSawuli, balahleka. Ngakho uKishi wasesithi kuSawuli indodana yakhe: Thatha enye inceku, uhambe uyedinga obabhemi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Badabula izintaba zakoEfrayimi, badabula ilizwe laseShalisha, kodwa kabababonanga. Basebedabula ilizwe laseShalima, kodwa babengekho lalapho. Basebedabula ilizwe lakoBenjamini, kodwa kabababonanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi sebefikile elizweni laseZufi, uSawuli wathi encekwini yakhe eyayilaye: Woza sibuyele, hlezi ubaba ayekele ukucabanga ngabobabhemi abesenqinekela thina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa yona yathi kuye: Kukhona kulumuzi umuntu kaNkulunkulu, ungumuntu ohloniphekayo ngoba konke akutshoyo kuya kwenzeke. Asiye kuye; mhlawumbe angasitshela ngalokho esihamba ngakho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "USawuli wasesithi encekwini yakhe: Uba sisiya kuye, sizamphathelani lowomuntu na? Ngoba kakuselakudla emigodleni yethu; futhi kasilasipho esingasiphathela lowomuntu kaNkulunkulu. Silani na? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inceku yabuya yamphendula uSawuli yathi: Ngilakho lapha okwesine ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " lesiliva, ngizamnika khona lowomuntu kaNkulunkulu ukuba asitshele ngohambo lwethu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "— Endulo koIsrayeli lapho umuntu esiyabuza kuNkulunkulu, wayesithi: Woza siye kumboni; ngoba lo osethiwa ngumprofethi lamuhla kuqala kwakuthiwa ngumboni. — ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "USawuli wasesithi encekwini yakhe: Kuhle lokho; wozake sihambe. Basebehamba besiya emzini lapho kwakukhona lowomuntu kaNkulunkulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Besakhwela umqanso womuzi bahlangana lamantombazana esiyakukha amanzi, bathi kuwo: Umboni ukhona na? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aphendula athi: Ukhona, nanguya ngaphambi kwenu. Phangisani kodwa; usand’ukufika ekhaya ngoba abantu balomhlatshelo lamuhla endaweni ephakemeyo yokukhonzela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lizamfumana lisangena nje ngekhaya engakayikudla endaweni ephakemeyo yokukhonzela; abantu kabayikudla engakafiki, ngoba nguye obusisa umhlatshelo, andubana badle abamenyiweyo. Hambanike, lizamfumana masinyane nje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basebesiya emzini; besangena emzini, bambona uSamuweli ehlangabezana labo esiya endaweni ephakemeyo yokukhonzela.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngosuku olungaphambili uSawuli engakafiki, iNkosi yamambulela uSamuweli yathi: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kusasa ngalesisikhathi ngizathumela kuwe umuntu ovela elizweni lakoBenjamini, umgcobe abe ngumbusi wabantu bami uIsrayeli; uzakhulula abantu bami ezandleni zamaFilistiya. Ngibonile ukuhlupheka kwabantu bami, lokukhala kwabo kufinyelele kimi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi uSamuweli ebona uSawuli, iNkosi yathi kuye: Nanguke umuntu ebengikhuluma ngaye kuwe. Nguye lo ozabusa abantu bami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "USawuli wasondela kuSamuweli ngasemnyango wathi: Akungitshele ukuba ingaphi indlu yomboni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "USamuweli wamphendula uSawuli wathi: Yimi umboni; hamba phambili uye endaweni ephakemeyo yokukhonzela, ngoba lamuhla uzakudla lami; kusasa ngizakukuyekela uhambe ngikutshele konke okusenhliziyweni yakho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mayelana lobabhemi bakho asebelensuku ezintathu belahlekile, ungabe usazihlupha ngabo, ngoba sebebonakele. Kodwa kuyini abakukhalelayo bonke abakoIsrayeli na? Nguwe lendlu yonke yakwenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "USawuli waphendula wathi: Kangisuye owakoBenjamini, isizwe esincinyane kulazo zonke izizwe zakoIsrayeli na? Lendlu yakwethu kayincinyane kulazo zonke izindlu zesizwe sakoBenjamini na? Phoke, ukhulumelani kimi ngalindlela na? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "USamuweli wasemthatha uSawuli lenceku yakhe, wabangenisa endlini yokudlela, wabahlalisa endaweni engaphambi kwabamenyiweyo, ababengamatshumi amathathu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "USamuweli wasesithi kumpheki: Letha isabelo senyama engikunike sona, ngakutshela ukuba usilondoloze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umpheki wasethatha umlenze lesinqe, wakubeka phambi kukaSawuli. USamuweli wathi: Nanku obekelwe khona, kubekwe phambi kwakho. Dlana; ngoba bekubekelwe wena kuze kufike lesisikhathi ukuba udle labamenyiweyo. USawuli wadla loSamuweli ngalolosuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sebedlile endaweni ephakemeyo yokukhonzela bangena emzini, bamendlalela uSawuli phezulu ophahleni, walala khona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nxa kusayo, uSamuweli wambiza uSawuli ophahleni wathi: Vuka ukuze ngikuqhube. Wasevuka uSawuli, baphumela phandle bobabili, yena loSamuweli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sebesehlela ekucineni komuzi, uSamuweli wathi kuSawuli: Tshela inceku ukuba yedlule. Lapho isiyedlule, uSamuweli wasesithi: Wena akume lapha kancinyane, ukuze ngikutshele ilizwi likaNkulunkulu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
